<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Обо мне</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Impact, Haettenschweiler, "Arial Narrow Bold", sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #ffffff;

            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78)),
                url("background.jpg") center / cover fixed no-repeat;
        }

        header {
            padding: 35px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
            border-bottom: 2px solid #d89432;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #e9a644;
            text-shadow: 3px 3px 5px #000000;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #dddddd;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        main {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 40px auto;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .intro h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #e9a644;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .card {
            padding: 25px;
            min-height: 190px;
            background: rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.86);
            border: 1px solid #a56e29;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            transition: transform 0.3s, background 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            background: rgba(30, 25, 18, 0.95);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: #e9a644;
            font-size: 27px;
        }

        .card p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #eeeeee;
        }

        .card ul {
            padding-left: 25px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #eeeeee;
        }

        .score {
            text-align: center;
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .score-number {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 64px;
            color: #e9a644;
            text-shadow: 3px 3px 5px #000000;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 45px;
            padding: 22px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            color: #cccccc;
            border-top: 2px solid #d89432;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .score {
                grid-column: auto;
            }

            body {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Обо мне</h1>
        <p>Личная страница ученика</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="intro">
            <h2>Краткая информация</h2>
            <p>
